  <biblio xml:id="st-bib-sga4-2" label="SGA4-II" type="raw">Michael Artin, Alexandre Grothendieck, and Jean-Louis Verdier, directors. <em>Théorie des topos et cohomologie étale des schémas</em>, Tome 2, Exposés V–VIII. Séminaire de géométrie algébrique du Bois-Marie 1963–1964 (SGA 4). Lecture Notes in Mathematics 270. Springer, 1972. <url href="https://doi.org/10.1007/BFb0061319">Publisher</url>. The general-topos cohomology and descent material is used here; the arithmetic étale theory is outside these notes.</biblio>
